#: app/Resources/Options.php:2063
msgid "Hard cap on the number of listings any single import run will create. Google Places enforces an upper bound of 60."
msgstr "Absolute Obergrenze für die Anzahl der Anzeigen, die ein einzelner Importdurchlauf erstellt. Google Places erzwingt eine Obergrenze von 60."

#: app/Resources/Options.php:2067
msgid "Default Fallback Image URL"
msgstr "Standard-Fallback-Bild-URL"

#: app/Resources/Options.php:2071
msgid "Image used when an importer is configured to use a fallback instead of (or in addition to) source photos. Paste any publicly-reachable image URL. Leave empty to disable the fallback option."
